<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<!-- @pageTitle = Sillydelphia Film Festival -->

<!-- @include "global/head.kit"-->

<body class="project-page">
    <!-- @include "global/header_nav.kit" -->

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="title-frame margins">
                <h1 class="project-title puzzle-type puzzle-auto" data-vertical-align="bottom">Sillydelphia</h1>
                <h5 class="desc">SUBHEAD GOES HERE</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video hero-image" id="L1" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil1.jpg');padding:61.67% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239205?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil1_bumper-hero">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="tags-frame margins">
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Logo</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Strategy</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Identity</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="adjectives margins">
                <p>familiar</p>
                <p>casual</p>
                <p>comforting</p>
                <p>quick</p>
                <p>satisfying</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="intro margins">
            <h5>
                We originally met with Oskar and Katrina about T-shirt designs for Bob & Barbara’s Lounge when they shared that they needed a brand identity for their new restaurant next&nbsp;door.
            </h5>
        </section>
        <section class="content margins" id="window">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/sil2_logo-banner.jpg" alt="Logo banner" class="width6" id="sil2">
          
            <div class="small-img width3">
                <div class="vimeo-video" id="sil3" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil3.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                    <iframe 
                        src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239206?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0" 
                        frameborder="0" 
                        allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                        title="sil3_logo-variants">
                    </iframe>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p class="width3">
                The Lemonade Stand was built on gumption from the start. We were packed with work when AJ convinced us to take him on and we tried out a new <span class="italics">design sprint</span> model. We designed the logos in two weeks with meetings squeezed into lunch breaks, nights, and weekends. It was an absolute&nbsp;blast.
            </p>

            <div class="width2"> </div> <!-- Filler Div-->

            <div class="vimeo-video width4" id="sil4" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil4.jpg');padding:73.87% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1199239211?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;" 
                    title="sil4_movie-clips-placeholder">
                </iframe>
            </div>

            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="sil5" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/sil5.jpg');padding:135.37% 0 0 0;">
